    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market Apartment 43, 55 Mountjoy Square West, a lovely top-floor 2-bed apartment with a B energy rating, which is located in a  purpose-built apartment block,there is a beautiful view onto the Dublin mountains and there are well maintained common area roof terrace and garden area . This highly sought-after city centre location is only minutes from O'Connell Street, Parnell Street, LUAS stop cross-city city line , Connolly Station (LUAS, DART and rail services) all within a short walk. \n\nService Charge\napprox . 3,400 per annum \n\nCroke Park Stadium is within minute's walk, with the Mater, Rotunda and Temple Street Hospitals all nearby. There is an abundance of city centre bars, shops and schools nearby. Easy Access to Mountjoy Square and Charles Street Great.\n\nPlease contact DNG on 01 8300989 Local Agents Brian McGee MIPAV, Ciarán Jones MIPAV, Michelle Keeley MIPAV, Isabel O`Neill and Vincent Mullen MIPAV."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - \nThe hallway is well lit and provides access to the storage area.\n\nStorage - 0.67m x 1.53m\nConvenient built in storage with shelving.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.4m x 2.7m\nA spacious front facing bedroom featuring built-in storage.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.5m x 2.16m\nBedroom located at the front of the property with built-in stoarge and laminate flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.96m x 1.84m\nBathroom with a tiled floor, comprising a bath, wash hand basin and wc.\n\nKitchen/living/dining area. - \nSpacious and bright open plan kitchen, dining and living area, offering an ideal space for modern family living and entertaining\n\nOutside - \nResidents have access to a communal rooftop garden, as well as an internal communal courtyard with secure bicycle parking.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B\nBER No: 113013106\n"
      },
